{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/probability/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/probability.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Probability — Basics & Events","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Probability</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Core ideas</h2><div class=\"muted mt-2\">Probability is a number between 0 and 1 that measures how likely an event is. P(A)= favourable outcomes / total outcomes for equally likely cases.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Venn diagram — events</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm muted\">Overlap shows intersection P(A∩B). Use inclusion-exclusion: P(A∪B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A∩B).</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- Venn diagram SVG -->\n        <svg width=\"320\" height=\"120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#2563eb\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#be185d\"></circle>\n          <text x=\"92\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#063970\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"232\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6b0b3a\">B</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Probability tree (conditional)</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted text-sm\">Trees help list sequential outcomes and calculate combined probabilities.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- simple tree SVG -->\n        <svg width=\"360\" height=\"120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#111827\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#111827\"></line>\n          <text x=\"8\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"11\">Start</text>\n          <text x=\"125\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\">A (p)</text>\n          <text x=\"125\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"11\">¬A (1-p)</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Fair coin — P(heads)?</div><input id=\"prob1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"pb1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"phb1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"pfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Ace from 52-card deck?</div><input id=\"prob2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/13\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"pb2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"phb2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"pfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"probQuiz\" class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"probModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"probContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"probClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-emerald-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}